Hi,

To my knowledge, it's challenging to perform what you asked in Stan. It's partly because Stan, which hBayesDM uses, does not support sampling discrete parameters: https://mc-stan.org/docs/2_22/stan-users-guide/latent-discrete-chapter.html. I believe there's some tricks to sample discrete parameters in Stan, which I found not-quite-satisfactory when I tried them some time ago.

Best,
Young

